#
# slang warning options on top of -Weverything. One option per line, each followed by
# "# <reason>". A line without a reason is rejected when the lint flow loads this file.
-Wno-unused-def  # file lists hold whole libraries (bag_sync, ...); unused modules are expected
-Wno-case-redundant-default  # every case lists its enum values and keeps a default for X/reset safety
-Wno-useless-cast  # width casts in parameterized RTL are identities for some parameter values
-Wno-unused-but-set-variable  # the `unused` sink idiom; unused signals are checked by Verilator UNUSED*
